  "title": "Kid-Friendly Taco-Burritos",
  "description": "These fast, easy, bean taco-burritos stay together nicely, so your little one can eat the WHOLE THING! Refried beans, lettuce, tomato, avocado, green onions and cheese are put in a tortilla, folded over, and folded again into a wedge shape. The wedge shape keeps everything contained!",
  "authors": [
